[00:16.44]Them that's got, shall get
[00:19.05]（他们有，应该有）
[00:19.41]Them that's not, shall lose
[00:23.01]（不是的人会输的）
[00:24.27]So the Bible said, and it still is news
[00:31.92]（所以圣经说，这仍然是新闻）
[00:34.08]Mama may have, and papa may have
[00:38.91]（妈妈可能有，爸爸可能有）
[00:41.37]God bless' the child
[00:43.65]（上帝保佑孩子）
[00:44.94]That's got his own
[00:49.26]（那是他自己的）
[00:52.56]That's got his own
[00:53.04]（那是他自己的）
[00:53.79]Yes the strong seem to get more
[00:56.64]（是的，强者似乎越来越多）
[00:59.40]While the weak ones fade
[01:01.62]（弱者逐渐消退）
[01:04.23]Empty pockets don't
[01:07.26]（空口袋不行）
[01:08.61]Ever make the grade
[01:09.60]（有史以来的成绩）
[01:10.02]As mama may have
[01:12.90]（就像妈妈一样）
[01:16.65]And papa may have
[01:17.55]（爸爸可能有）
[01:20.25]God bless' the child
[01:21.39]（上帝保佑孩子）
[01:23.07]That's got his own
[01:24.51]（那是他自己的）
[01:26.97]That's got his own
[01:30.81]（那是他自己的）
[01:31.17]And when you got money
[01:39.24]（当你有钱的时候）
[01:39.69]You got a lots of friends
[01:43.32]（你有很多朋友）
[01:43.68]Crowdin' 'round your door
[01:44.46]（拥挤在你的门周围）
[01:51.69]When the money's gone
[01:54.06]（当钱不见了）
[01:55.26]And all you're spendin' ends
[01:57.24]（而你所花费的一切）
[01:59.52]They won't be 'round any more
[02:00.21]（它们不会再圆了）
[02:00.96]No, no, no more
[02:01.83]（不，不，不再）
[02:04.83]And rich relations
[02:06.36]（和丰富的关系）
[02:09.39]May give you
[02:09.60]（可以给你）
[02:09.84]A crust of bread and such
[02:12.00]（面包皮之类的）
[02:13.92]You can help yourself
[02:15.69]（你可以自己动手）
[02:16.47]But don't take too much
[02:20.13]（但不要吃太多）
[02:20.82]Mama may have
[02:24.33]（妈妈可能有）
[02:26.61]And your papa may have
[02:28.17]（你爸爸可能有）
[02:29.85]But God bless' the child
[02:32.43]（但上帝保佑孩子）
[02:37.44]That's got his own
[04:06.99]（那是他自己的）
[04:21.03]That's got his own
[04:40.29]（那是他自己的）
[04:40.65]God bless' the child who can stand up and say
[04:52.02]（上帝保佑能站起来说话的孩子）
[04:59.16]I've got my own
[04:59.58]（我有自己的）
[04:59.97]Ev'ry child's, got to have his own!
[05:00.69]（每个孩子都要有自己的孩子！）
